<resources>
    <string name="lid_observation_title">Case opening test (experimental)</string>
    <string name="lid_observation_summary">Scan nearby Bluetooth broadcasts for 30 seconds to check AirPods 5 case opening and closing. This does not enable a connection popup.</string>
    <string name="lid_observation_instructions">Start with the case closed. Mark it closed, open it and mark it open, then close and mark again. Wait a few seconds between actions. Do not reset, unpair, or change firmware.</string>
    <string name="lid_observation_privacy">This test needs nearby-device permission. Scan results may not be your headphones. Reports exclude device addresses, names, keys and raw broadcasts. Data is not saved to a file; copy it before leaving. Closing this panel or backgrounding the app stops scanning. Android may hide some broadcasts, so no results do not mean your headphones are incompatible.</string>
